<li id="bib.bib6" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_article"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhao <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2026)</span>
