<a href="#S2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" title="On-Policy Self-Distillation. ‣ 2 Preliminaries ‣ Be My Tutor: On-Policy Co-Distillation for Mutual LLM Improvement via Peer Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2</span></a>,
<a href="#S6.p2.1" title="6 Related Works ‣ Be My Tutor: On-Policy Co-Distillation for Mutual LLM Improvement via Peer Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§6</span></a>.
