<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Formal Definitions of Pareto Criteria</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Consider two students indexed by <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\{1,2\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\{1,2\}</annotation></semantics></math> and two domains <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\in\{A,B\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\in\{A,B\}</annotation></semantics></math>. Let <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{d}(\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{d}(\pi)</annotation></semantics></math> denote the evaluation score of policy <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math> on domain <math id="A1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>, where higher scores indicate better performance.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Pareto dominance)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">A policy <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math> <em id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_upright">Pareto-dominates</em> a policy <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, denoted <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\pi\succ_{\mathrm{P}}\pi^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>≻</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">P</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\succ_{\mathrm{P}}\pi^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, if</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex3X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle s_{d}(\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle s_{d}(\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq s_{d}(\pi^{\prime}),\quad\forall d\in\{A,B\},\text{ and}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"> and</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq s_{d}(\pi^{\prime}),\quad\forall d\in\{A,B\},\text{ and}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex3Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle s_{d}(\pi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle s_{d}(\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle&gt;s_{d}(\pi^{\prime}),\quad\exists d\in\{A,B\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∃</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle&gt;s_{d}(\pi^{\prime}),\quad\exists d\in\{A,B\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Pareto improvement)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Training from an initial policy <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> to a learned policy <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math> <em id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_upright">achieves Pareto improvement</em> if</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\pi\succ_{\mathrm{P}}\pi_{0}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>≻</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>P</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\succ_{\mathrm{P}}\pi_{0}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition A.3</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Mutual Pareto improvement)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Training from initial policies <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{0}^{1},\pi_{0}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{0}^{1},\pi_{0}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> to learned policies <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi^{1},\pi^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi^{1},\pi^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> <em id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_upright">achieves mutual Pareto improvement</em> if</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\pi^{i}\succ_{\mathrm{P}}\pi_{0}^{i},\quad\forall i\in\{1,2\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><msub><mo>≻</mo><mi>P</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi^{i}\succ_{\mathrm{P}}\pi_{0}^{i},\quad\forall i\in\{1,2\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Pseudo-Code</h2>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> On-Policy Co-Distillation (OPCoD)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> Initial students <math id="alg1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{1}^{1},\pi_{1}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{1}^{1},\pi_{1}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, threshold <math id="alg1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, rounds <math id="alg1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math>, steps <math id="alg1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="alg1.4.2.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=1,\dots,R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=1,\dots,R</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">  
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
          Compute cognizance gaps <math id="alg1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{r}^{1},\Delta_{r}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{r}^{1},\Delta_{r}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> at round <math id="alg1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> using
validation scores (Eq. (<a href="#S3.E2" title="In Cognizance-Based Gating. ‣ 3.2 When to Give Feedback: Cognizance-Based Gating ‣ 3 OPCoD: On-Policy Co-Distillation ‣ Be My Tutor: On-Policy Co-Distillation for Mutual LLM Improvement via Peer Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>))
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline">  
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\pi}_{r}^{1}\leftarrow\pi_{r}^{1},\quad\bar{\pi}_{r}^{2}\leftarrow\pi_{r}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\pi}_{r}^{1}\leftarrow\pi_{r}^{1},\quad\bar{\pi}_{r}^{2}\leftarrow\pi_{r}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>   <span id="alg1.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="alg1.4.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Frozen tutors</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline">  
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="alg1.4.5.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\{1,2\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\{1,2\}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline">    
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}\leftarrow\pi_{r}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>tutee</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}\leftarrow\pi_{r}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math>,
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline">    
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\mathrm{tutor}}\leftarrow\bar{\pi}_{r}^{-i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>tutor</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>π</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\mathrm{tutor}}\leftarrow\bar{\pi}_{r}^{-i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline">    
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="alg1.4.8.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=1,\dots,K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=1,\dots,K</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline">      
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="alg1.4.9.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="alg1.4.9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline">        
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m14" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="y^{1},\dots,y^{n}\sim\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}(\cdot\mid x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>tutee</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y^{1},\dots,y^{n}\sim\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}(\cdot\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline">        
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> correct rollout in <math id="alg1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{y^{j}\}_{j=1}^{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{y^{j}\}_{j=1}^{n}</annotation></semantics></math>, if any; otherwise <math id="alg1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline">        
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="alg1.4.12.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="alg1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{r}^{tutor}\leq\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{r}^{tutor}\leq\tau</annotation></semantics></math></em>   <span id="alg1.4.12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="alg1.4.12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Cognizant</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.13" class="ltx_listingline">          
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
          Generate and sanitize feedback using
feedback anchoring (Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Feedback Anchoring Process ‣ Be My Tutor: On-Policy Co-Distillation for Mutual LLM Improvement via Peer Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>)
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.14" class="ltx_listingline">          
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m19" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="f^{j}\sim\pi_{\text{tutor}}(\cdot|x,y^{j}),~\forall j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>tutor</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{j}\sim\pi_{\text{tutor}}(\cdot|x,y^{j}),~\forall j</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.15" class="ltx_listingline">          
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">15</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{j}\leftarrow\text{Sanitize}(f^{j}),~\forall j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Sanitize</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{j}\leftarrow\text{Sanitize}(f^{j}),~\forall j</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.16" class="ltx_listingline">          
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">16</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>  <span id="alg1.4.16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="alg1.4.16.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Incognizant</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.17" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">17</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f^{1},\dots,f^{n}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f^{1},\dots,f^{n}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.18" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">18</span></span>
          end if
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.19" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">19</span></span>
          end foreach
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.20" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">20</span></span>
          Update <math id="alg1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>tutee</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="alg1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}^{i}(\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}};\pi_{tutor})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>tutee</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}^{i}(\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}};\pi_{tutor})</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. (<a href="#S3.E1" title="In Within One Round. ‣ 3.1 Co-Distillation Framework ‣ 3 OPCoD: On-Policy Co-Distillation ‣ Be My Tutor: On-Policy Co-Distillation for Mutual LLM Improvement via Peer Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>))
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.21" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">21</span></span>
          end for
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.22" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">22</span></span>
          <math id="alg1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{r+1}^{i}\leftarrow\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>tutee</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{r+1}^{i}\leftarrow\pi_{\mathrm{tutee}}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.23" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">23</span></span>
          end for
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.24" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">24</span></span>
          end for
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.25" class="ltx_listingline">            
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.4.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">25</span></span>
          <span id="alg1.4.25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Return:</span> <math id="alg1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{R+1}^{1},\pi_{R+1}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{R+1}^{1},\pi_{R+1}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="alg1.4.26" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Feedback Anchoring Process</h2>

<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Prompts for Feedback Generation</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="70.53" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 70.53" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,70.53) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#BFBFBF;" fill="#BFBFBF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.32 L 0 67.21 C 0 69.04 1.49 70.53 3.32 70.53 L 649.83 70.53 C 651.66 70.53 653.15 69.04 653.15 67.21 L 653.15 3.32 C 653.15 1.49 651.66 0 649.83 0 L 3.32 0 C 1.49 0 0 1.49 0 3.32 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.55 3.32 L 0.55 49.25 L 652.6 49.25 L 652.6 3.32 C 652.6 1.79 651.36 0.55 649.83 0.55 L 3.32 0.55 C 1.79 0.55 0.55 1.79 0.55 3.32 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.03 56.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.78em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="550.44"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:39.78em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt for feedback generation with generic instruction</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.03 13.48)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:45.75em;--ltx-fo-height:1.9em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="29.75" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.29)" width="633.05"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:45.75em;">
<span id="A3.SS1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><span class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></span>
<span id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">are</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">domain</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">expert</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">reviewing</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">student</span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">’</span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">s</span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">response</span><span id="lstnumberx1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">conversation</span><span id="lstnumberx1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">or</span><span id="lstnumberx1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">problem</span><span id="lstnumberx1.30" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span>
</span>
<span id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Read</span><span id="lstnumberx2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">full</span><span id="lstnumberx2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">context</span><span id="lstnumberx2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">below</span><span id="lstnumberx2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">then</span><span id="lstnumberx2.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">evaluate</span><span id="lstnumberx2.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">the</span><span id="lstnumberx2.17" class="l